22
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:16,060
i l'he deixat enxufat d'una hora i pico, i no.

23
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:18,920
M'ha pujat un 5-6%.

24
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:21,620
Llavors, bueno, doncs res,

25
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:25,000
