40
00:02:00,460 --> 00:02:01,180
Que aguante, que aguante.

41
00:02:01,180 --> 00:02:02,820
Que guante.

42
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:11,560
Que guante.

43
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:14,660
Que guante.

44
00:02:14,660 --> 00:02:14,800
Que guante.

45
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,760
Que guante.

46
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:25,980
Que guante.

47
00:02:25,980 --> 00:02:26,060
Que guante.

48
00:02:26,060 --> 00:02:26,880
