Sí, dormim a Morgab.

54
00:04:00,580 --> 00:04:01,360
És bo.

55
00:04:01,780 --> 00:04:02,140
És bo?

56
00:04:02,340 --> 00:04:03,840
O és el que és.

57
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:07,240
Bé, doncs, adeu!

58
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,160
Adeu.

59
00:04:12,060 --> 00:04:13,260
Però ara som motos, eh?

60
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:14,640
Adeu.

61
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,640
Per cert,

62
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:20,000
