80
00:04:54,660 --> 00:04:55,600
La una i mitja,

81
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:55,660
la mitja,

82
00:04:56,180 --> 00:04:57,000
25,

83
00:04:57,020 --> 00:04:59,160
25 quilòmetres i gairebé 5 hores de marxa.

84
00:04:59,980 --> 00:05:01,120
Si avui volgués fer

85
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,040
