110
00:06:08,020 --> 00:06:10,020
No, van passant els quilòmetres,

111
00:06:10,020 --> 00:06:12,020
però passen lents i lents.

112
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:15,020
Ja ho sabia, això, eh?

113
00:06:15,020 --> 00:06:16,020
Com vaig venir aquí.

114
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:17,020
Ja ho sabia.

115
00:06:17,020 --> 00:06:20,020
I mira, avui, fa millor dia que ahir,

116
00:06:20,020 --> 00:06:23,020
el vent el tinc darrere, és a dir, m'empeny.

117
00:06:24,020 --> 00:06:26,020
No fa tant de vent, encara que fa una mica de vent.

118
00:06:27,020 --> 00:06:29,020
Però igualment és dur, eh?

119
00:06:31,020 --> 00:06:33,020
Igualment és, és dur.

120
00:06:33,020 --> 00:06:36,020
Com no fa calor, doncs no estic gastant aigua.

121
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:38,020
I encara tinc, he sortit amb un litre,

122
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:40,020
i no sé quan em queda, però encara en tinc.

123
00:06:40,020 --> 00:06:42,020
Home, abans d'acampar hauré de demanar,

124
00:06:42,020 --> 00:06:44,020
perquè si no em quedaré sense, però...

125
00:06:45,020 --> 00:06:48,020
No cal, no cal beure molt.

126
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:50,020
Ostres, que bé, tu!

127
00:06:50,020 --> 00:06:53,020
Just 5 minuts després de gravar l'últim vídeo,

128
00:06:54,020 --> 00:06:56,020
passa aquesta furgoneta, para,

129
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:58,020
i resulta que són dos polacs, i em diuen

130
00:06:58,020 --> 00:07:00,020
que necessites aigua.

131
00:07:00,020 --> 00:07:02,020
I jo, sí, vinga, fot-li.

132
00:07:02,020 --> 00:07:04,020
He tret l'ampolla, encara tenia mitja ampolla,

133
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:06,020
però bueno, he begut tot el que he pogut,

134
00:07:06,020 --> 00:07:09,020
i me l'han omplert d'aigua de garrafa,

135
00:07:09,020 --> 00:07:11,020
no d'aigua de merda de Tadjikistan.

136
00:07:11,020 --> 00:07:13,020
Perdó per la paraula, eh?

137
00:07:14,020 --> 00:07:16,020
Sí, que a tu, molt bé, ja està.

138
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:18,020
Jo crec que potser per avui ja tinc, eh?

139
00:07:22,020 --> 00:07:24,020
Bueno, us en recordeu el primer dia

140
00:07:24,020 --> 00:07:27,020
que un home em va convidar al seu restaurant,

141
00:07:27,020 --> 00:07:29,020
bueno, a un restaurant a dormir?

142
00:07:29,020 --> 00:07:30,020
Doncs me l'he trobat aquí.

143
00:07:30,020 --> 00:07:32,020
What was your name again? I forgot.

144
00:07:32,020 --> 00:07:33,020
Sojournar.

145
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:36,020
Well, it's been more than one month,

146
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:37,020
but I manage.

147
00:07:37,020 --> 00:07:40,020
I'm, I think, four days away from China.

148
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:42,020
What are you doing here?

149
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:44,020
I'm taking here tourists.

150
00:07:44,020 --> 00:07:46,020
How do you like Pamir?

151
00:07:46,020 --> 00:07:49,020
Very well, very, absolutely great.

152
00:07:49,020 --> 00:07:51,020
It's great, but for walking it's hard.

153
00:07:51,020 --> 00:07:52,020
Yeah, yeah, of course.

154
00:07:52,020 --> 00:07:55,020
I wish you all the best in your walking.

155
00:07:55,020 --> 00:07:56,020
Thank you.

156
00:07:56,020 --> 00:07:58,020
No, no, thank to you, thank to you.

157
00:07:58,020 --> 00:08:00,020
You're watching my videos, eh?

158
00:08:00,020 --> 00:08:02,020
Of course, every day.

159
00:08:02,020 --> 00:08:03,020
Molt loco, tio.

160
00:08:03,020 --> 00:08:06,020
Well, it's been amazing to find you, eh?

161
00:08:06,020 --> 00:08:07,020
You're going to Murghab, right?

162
00:08:07,020 --> 00:08:08,020
Yeah, of course.

163
00:08:08,020 --> 00:08:10,020
Maybe we'll see each other there.

164
00:08:10,020 --> 00:08:11,020
I arrive tomorrow.

165
00:08:11,020 --> 00:08:12,020
Yeah, of course.

166
00:08:12,020 --> 00:08:13,020
Bye-bye.

167
00:08:13,020 --> 00:08:14,020
Bye.

168
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:15,020
Thank you very much. Adeu.

169
00:08:18,020 --> 00:08:20,020
Actualitzaciós són les quatre.

170
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:21,020
Molt loco, tio.

171
00:08:22,020 --> 00:08:25,020
Us en recordeu, no?, d'aquest home?

172
00:08:25,020 --> 00:08:28,020
Potser no vaig ensenyar la seva cara, d'aquí penso.

173
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:30,020
Sí, sí, vaig dormir a un restaurant, allà.

174
00:08:33,020 --> 00:08:34,020
Boníssim.

175
00:08:34,020 --> 00:08:36,020
Mira, això m'ha pujat els ànims, tu.

176
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:43,020
Actualització a les cinc de la tarda.

177
00:08:44,020 --> 00:08:46,020
Aquí, caminant.

178
00:08:46,020 --> 00:08:48,020
Dia molt llarg, es fa molt llarg, eh?

179
00:08:48,020 --> 00:08:50,020
He de dir que la placa celular està funcionant.

180
00:08:50,020 --> 00:08:51,020
Eh...

181
00:08:51,020 --> 00:08:53,020
He sortit que tenia la placa...

182
00:08:53,020 --> 00:08:58,020
Bueno, he carregat el mòbil, tal, la tenia a 30 i pico, o 60 i pico, no recordo.

183
00:08:58,020 --> 00:09:00,020
L'he descarregat una estona, no he comptat.

184
00:09:00,020 --> 00:09:02,020
Ha pujat el 100, ha carregat tot.

185
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:05,020
He tornat a carregar el mòbil, ara l'he tornat a posar.

186
00:09:05,020 --> 00:09:07,020
Per tant, sembla que guai.

187
00:09:07,020 --> 00:09:10,020
A veure, aquí us deixo un enllaç.

188
00:09:10,020 --> 00:09:13,020
Per si la voleu comprar, és de l'Express.

189
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:15,020
També la descripció del vídeo.

190
00:09:15,020 --> 00:09:20,020
Recordeu que jo m'he hagut de comprar una bateria, entre cometes, dolenta, de 10.000,

191
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:24,020
per poder-la fer servir, perquè amb la de 20.000 pepina...

192
00:09:24,020 --> 00:09:26,020
no anava, vale?

193
00:09:26,020 --> 00:09:29,020
Llavors, bueno, tindre-ho en compte.

194
00:09:29,020 --> 00:09:32,020
Però bueno, és molt lleugera i barata.

195
00:09:32,020 --> 00:09:35,020
Per tant, crec que val la pena intentar-ho.

196
00:09:35,020 --> 00:09:37,020
Si sou amants del senderisme.

197
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:49,020
Les 6 de la tarda,

198
00:09:49,020 --> 00:09:52,020
el tema de la posta de sol és un escàndol.

199
00:09:52,020 --> 00:09:55,020
Cada dia perdo 5 minuts, sense exagerar.

200
00:09:55,020 --> 00:09:58,020
O sigui, fa dos dies, s'anava a 34.

201
00:09:58,020 --> 00:10:01,020
Ara, a 27, crec.

202
00:10:01,020 --> 00:10:07,020
En fi, com veieu, ja vaig amb la jaqueta i els guants,

203
00:10:07,020 --> 00:10:10,020
que els tinc en la butxaca perquè els he tret.

204
00:10:10,020 --> 00:10:13,020
Ja fa rasca. Estic als 4.000 metres.

205
00:10:13,020 --> 00:10:15,020
Vull dir que ja pot fer rasca.

206
00:10:15,020 --> 00:10:17,020
Bueno, a veure fins quan segueixo.

207
00:10:19,020 --> 00:10:29,020
Les 7.12, 50,47 km, una animalada.

208
00:10:29,020 --> 00:10:31,020
Bueno, per què he caminat tant?

209
00:10:31,020 --> 00:10:35,020
Doncs perquè el mapi, avui no és l'Ajo Berlanda, és el mapi,

210
00:10:35,020 --> 00:10:40,020
diu que allà, no es veu, hi ha la icona de refugi.

211
00:10:40,020 --> 00:10:45,020
Però especifica que és parets sense sostre.

212
00:10:45,020 --> 00:10:48,020
Però bueno, tu, només que estigui...

213
00:10:49,020 --> 00:10:51,020
doncs una mica protegit del vent, ja en val la pena.

214
00:10:51,020 --> 00:10:53,020
Ara estic a la Pamir.

215
00:10:53,020 --> 00:10:55,020
La highway, la carretera, doncs em desvio.

216
00:10:55,020 --> 00:10:57,020
I són uns 200 metres cap allà.

217
00:10:57,020 --> 00:10:58,020
No veig absolutament res.

218
00:10:58,020 --> 00:11:00,020
Bueno, amb l'afrontal sí, eh.

219
00:11:00,020 --> 00:11:02,020
A veure com és el lloc.

220
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:08,020
Doncs estic aquí.

221
00:11:08,020 --> 00:11:10,020
I no hi ha absolutament res.

222
00:11:10,020 --> 00:11:12,020
Ni walls, ni roof, ni res.

223
00:11:12,020 --> 00:11:14,020
Res, res, res. Bueno.

224
00:11:14,020 --> 00:11:17,020
Venim per aquí. Era molt pla.

225
00:11:17,020 --> 00:11:19,020
I no feia vent perquè aquestes muntanyes d'aquí,

226
00:11:19,020 --> 00:11:21,020
que suposo que no es veuen,

227
00:11:21,020 --> 00:11:23,020
parapeten el vent.

228
00:11:23,020 --> 00:11:26,020
Llavors doncs simplement em posaré aquí.

229
00:11:26,020 --> 00:11:29,020
A aquesta esplanada i ja està.

230
00:11:29,020 --> 00:11:31,020
No, a veure, és un bon lloc.

231
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:33,020
També he de dir que avui no fa massa vent, eh.

232
00:11:33,020 --> 00:11:36,020
Vull dir, jo a la Pamir m'havia acompat uns vents,

233
00:11:36,020 --> 00:11:39,020
m'havia acompat quatre piquetes, us en recordeu?

234
00:11:39,020 --> 00:11:41,020
Uf, jo no puc ni parlar.

235
00:11:41,020 --> 00:11:45,020
Doncs ni falta agafant, eh, quan venim avui.

236
00:11:45,020 --> 00:11:47,020
Resto. Molt bé.

237
00:11:47,020 --> 00:11:54,020
Doncs planto, em fico dintre la tenda, menjo i fem resum.

238
00:11:54,020 --> 00:11:57,020
51 quilòmetres avui.

239
00:11:57,020 --> 00:12:03,020
Dos cafès, cap refresc i zero euros gastats.

240
00:12:03,020 --> 00:12:05,020
Uf, duríssim, eh.

241
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:07,020
Dia...

242
00:12:07,020 --> 00:12:10,020
Duríssim, duríssim, duríssim.

243
00:12:10,020 --> 00:12:13,020
I demà queden...

244
00:12:13,020 --> 00:12:15,020
Queden cinquanta...

245
00:12:15,020 --> 00:12:20,020
sis, no, cinquanta-quatre, cinquanta-tres quilòmetres fins a Murgap.

246
00:12:20,020 --> 00:12:22,020
He decidit que demà no faré vídeo.

247
00:12:22,020 --> 00:12:24,020
No, perquè al final què serà el vídeo?

248
00:12:24,020 --> 00:12:26,020
Serà igual que avui.

249
00:12:26,020 --> 00:12:29,020
Carretera, monotonia, pam-pam-pam, cansadíssim.

250
00:12:29,020 --> 00:12:32,020
I mira, si no faig el vídeo com a mínim em trec un...

251
00:12:32,020 --> 00:12:35,020
un pes mental de sobre, no?

252
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:37,020
Sí, sí, sí, sí.

253
00:12:37,020 --> 00:12:39,020
A veure, demà en tauria m'aixecaré més d'hora.

254
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:41,020
Llavors, en principi hauré d'arribar abans,

255
00:12:41,020 --> 00:12:42,020
no hauré d'apurar tant...

256
00:12:42,020 --> 00:12:44,020
tant...

257
00:12:44,020 --> 00:12:47,020
Estic content d'haver fet el cinquanta perquè havia començat tard, eh.

258
00:12:47,020 --> 00:12:49,020
Sí, sí, sí.

259
00:12:49,020 --> 00:12:51,020
Ara mateix no fa fred, no fa aire,

260
00:12:51,020 --> 00:12:54,020
però estic als 4.100 metres sobre el nivell del mar.

261
00:12:54,020 --> 00:12:56,020
Jo crec que...

262
00:12:56,020 --> 00:12:58,020
la nit serà freda.

263
00:12:58,020 --> 00:13:00,020
Bueno, llavors, ja que demà no hi haurà vídeo,

264
00:13:00,020 --> 00:13:02,020
faré alguna cosa per Insta.

265
00:13:02,020 --> 00:13:04,020
Ja us ho explico.

266
00:13:04,020 --> 00:13:06,020
Clar, quan arribi a Murgap

267
00:13:06,020 --> 00:13:08,020
ve el segon tram que us vaig dir l'altre dia, no?

268
00:13:08,020 --> 00:13:10,020
De Murgap fins la Xina.

269
00:13:10,020 --> 00:13:12,020
També són cent quilòmetres.

270
00:13:12,020 --> 00:13:14,020
O 90 i pico.

271
00:13:14,020 --> 00:13:16,020
Però no faré, com he fet aquesta vegada, de dividir-ho en dos dies.

272
00:13:16,020 --> 00:13:18,020
Perquè si divideixo en dos dies,

273
00:13:18,020 --> 00:13:20,020
el segon dia arribaria a la frontera tard.

274
00:13:20,020 --> 00:13:22,020
Arribaria a la frontera a l'hora de fer-se fosc.

275
00:13:22,020 --> 00:13:24,020
I a la frontera serà d'arribar d'hora.

276
00:13:24,020 --> 00:13:26,020
Per tant, el que faré

277
00:13:26,020 --> 00:13:28,020
en principi serà,

278
00:13:28,020 --> 00:13:30,020
demà passat, començar a caminar tard.

279
00:13:30,020 --> 00:13:32,020
Tipo, descansar bé.

280
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:34,020
A Murgap, a un hotel,

281
00:13:34,020 --> 00:13:36,020
poder descansar bé. I començar a caminar

282
00:13:36,020 --> 00:13:38,020
a la una, a les dos.

283
00:13:38,020 --> 00:13:40,020
Fer 20 quilòmetres, acampar.

284
00:13:40,020 --> 00:13:42,020
El dia següent fer 40 i pico fins a

285
00:13:42,020 --> 00:13:44,020
una parada de camioners

286
00:13:44,020 --> 00:13:46,020
que també et deixen dormir allà.

287
00:13:46,020 --> 00:13:48,020
Dormir allà. I l'últim dia,

288
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:50,020
és a dir, d'aquí,

289
00:13:50,020 --> 00:13:52,020
sense comptar avui, d'aquí quatre dies,

290
00:13:52,020 --> 00:13:54,020
fer els últims 27 quilòmetres fins a

291
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:56,020
Culmapàs. Són molts quilòmetres.

292
00:13:56,020 --> 00:13:58,020
Prefereiria acampar,

293
00:13:58,020 --> 00:14:00,020
o sigui, estar més a prop. Però bé, el fet que hi hagi

294
00:14:00,020 --> 00:14:02,020
el tema aquest de la parada

295
00:14:02,020 --> 00:14:04,020
de camioners, doncs, pararé allà.

296
00:14:04,020 --> 00:14:06,020
Però bé, això ja no ho he explicat.

297
00:14:06,020 --> 00:14:08,020
Però sí, hi haurà vídeo

298
00:14:08,020 --> 00:14:10,020
demà passat.

299
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:12,020
Vinga, bona nit.

300
00:14:12,020 --> 00:14:14,020
Fins demà!
